Subject: parallel invocation of ripple
Message-ID: <Pe462TPurNU.HlD3HlwQQ68J@rqtl-disc.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/rqtl-disc/c/Pe462TPurNU/m/HlD3HlwQQ68J>
